---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";
import { organization } from "../data/site";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Accessibility & visitor support"
  description="Contact us for accessibility support, learn about our website accessibility approach, and find alternatives to the Ludus ticket panel."
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Accessibility & visitor support"
    title="Belonging starts with access."
    summary="We want our website and theater experiences to be welcoming. Please tell us if something prevents you from finding information or taking part."
  />
  <section class="section container prose" aria-labelledby="support-heading">
    <h2 id="support-heading">Ask for assistance</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${organization.email}`}>{organization.email}</a> or
      call <a href={organization.phoneHref}>{organization.phone}</a> for help
      with tickets, website information, or performance accommodations. If
      reporting a website problem, include the page and what you were trying to
      do.
    </p>
    <h2>Website accessibility approach</h2>
    <p>
      Our target is WCAG 2.1 Level A and AA. The website uses semantic page
      structure, keyboard-accessible links, a skip link, visible focus
      indicators, responsive layouts, and reduced-motion support. Automated
      accessibility tests are part of the site's development checks.
    </p>
    <p>
      Automated checks cannot establish full WCAG conformance. Manual
      screen-reader, keyboard, zoom, and user testing remain necessary. We do
      not claim that an automated scan certifies this website.
    </p>
    <h2>Third-party ticket booking</h2>
    <p>
      Ludus provides our embedded ticket booking service. Its content and
      checkout are managed by Ludus and may have accessibility limitations that
      our team cannot directly change. A direct Ludus booking link and our
      contact details are available on the <a href="/tickets/">tickets page</a>
      as alternatives to the embedded panel. Neither the direct link nor the
      automated checks guarantees that the full checkout is accessible.
    </p>
    <h2>Performance access</h2>
    <p>
      Please contact us before booking to discuss your needs and the
      accommodations available for your chosen performance. Check the event
      listing for the performance venue; our office address is not a theater.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
